TIP:  The intro is fairly quick with three consecutive strums of (G7), (G6), and (G) and then strums of (G) and then it repeats.  From (G7) to (G6) just lift off the index finger.  Alternatively, you could pick the notes:  f - e - d,   e - f - f - e - d,   d - b - a - g, repeat.  (Notes may or may not transpose.)

TIP:  You can play regular (G) but the vocals accentuate note <d>, hence the four-fingered (Gadd). 


